argin__xS5ac">Use Notion offline on the desktop and mobile app.</p></div></div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D PricingGrid_contentTextItem__pYKXw" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Offline</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Choose pages to download for offline use.</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Recents and Favorites auto-download for offline use.</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Recents and Favorites auto-download for offline use.</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Recents and Favorites auto-download for offline use.</span></div></div></section><section class="PricingGrid_section__zeVWQ"><div class="PricingGrid_sectionLabel___YnU3"><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:var(--color-gray-500)">Sharing &amp; collaboration</span></div><div class="PricingGrid_row__bHvcz"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltipTarget__aovlU oldTooltip_fillSpace__glY_P"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltip__Thq7W" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltipText__k59No"><p class="text_text__cG3pf text_textWeightMedium__qgxjp text_textColorWhite__H70dC text_textSizeFootnote__gdfM_ text_textWithMargin__xS5ac">Invite individuals outside your organization to collaborate. Guests often include external clients and contractors. Contact Sales for a higher limit.</p></div></div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D PricingGrid_contentTextItem__pYKXw" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Guest seats</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">10</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">100</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">250</span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Starting at 250</span></div></div><div class="PricingGrid_row__bHvcz"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltipTarget__aovlU oldTooltip_fillSpace__glY_P"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltip__Thq7W" style="--tooltip-width:260px;top:auto;inset-inline-start:auto;visibility:hidden"><div class="oldTooltip_tooltipText__k59No"><p class="text_text__cG3pf text_textWeightMedium__qgxjp text_textColorWhite__H70dC text_textSizeFootnote__gdfM_ text_textWithMargin__xS5ac">Create dedicated areas for folks to work together, without creating information silos. People can join the teamspaces that interest them, and leave the ones that don’t.</p></div></div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D PricingGrid_contentTextItem__pYKXw" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography