xt_textSizeFootnote__gdfM_ text_textWithMargin__xS5ac">Export all your content at once as PDFs. Perfect for legal or compliance backups.</p></div></div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D PricingGrid_contentTextItem__pYKXw" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-semibold-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit">Export entire workspace as PDF</span></div><div></div><div></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--color-text-dark)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper_icon__In1uC"><defs fill="currentColor"></defs><path d="m56,18.24l-30,30L8,30.24l4.24-4.24,13.76,13.76,25.76-25.76,4.24,4.24Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div><span class="typography_typography__Exx2D" style="--typography-font:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-font-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-font);--typography-letter-spacing:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-letter-spacing-sm:var(--typography-sans-150-regular-letter-spacing);--typography-color:inherit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="1em" style="height:18px;width:18px;color:var(--color-text-dark)" class="NotionIconSvgWrapper_icon__In1uC"><defs fill="currentColor"></defs><path d="m56,18.24l-30,30L8,30.24l4.24-4.24,13.76,13.76,25.76-25.76,4.24,4.24Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></